<title>UK: Statkraft sets 400 million Dkr bond due Dec 2002.</title>
<headline>Statkraft sets 400 million Dkr bond due Dec 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Den Danske and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATKRAFT</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.80    PAY DATE   L18.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  HOME CTRY  NOKWAY    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
